   orthogonal field; moving in place is allowed and counts as movement.
    - ProgrammingWT2526-Final1 implements blockade mechanics: a unit may initiate or end a Blockade
  only if it has not yet moved this turn; initiating/ending a blockade counts as the unit's movement
   and the blockade holds until the unit next moves.
