  defines Duell blockade resolution: if the defending unit is in Blockade, the attacker wins iff
  ATK_A > DEF_B and the defending unit is removed; if ATK_A < DEF_B the attacking team takes DEF_B −
   ATK_A damage and the attacker remains on its original field; if ATK_A = DEF_B both units and
  teams remain unharmed.
